  "short_description": "親手畫出魚兒，打造溫馨的小水族箱，還能把它設為動態桌面壁紙！看著自己的畫作活過來，餵養和照顧小魚，收集金色魚鱗來解鎖新裝飾。遊戲還準備了實用工具，幫你專注學習工作，也能輕鬆放空。",
  "short_description_en": "Draw your very own fish and build a cozy little aquarium. And if you like, set it as your animated desktop wallpaper! Watch your drawings come to life. Feed them, raise them and collect golden scales to unlock new decorations. There's also some handy tools to help you focus and unwind.",
